.TH GSUDO 1 "September, 2026"

.SH NAME
\fBgsudo\fP \- graphical interface to \fBsudo\fP

.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgsudo\fP \fIcmd\fP [\fIargs\fP]...
.br
\fBgsudo\fP \fB\-s\fP [\fIcmd\fP]...

.SH DESCRIPTION
This is a graphical frontend for
.IR sudo (1).
It prompts the user for their password with a graphical UI, and otherwise performs identically to \fBsudo\fP.

.SS Options

.TP
.B \-s [\fIcommand...\fP]
Run the configured \fB$SHELL\fP once privileges are successfully elevated.
If \fIcommand\fP is provided, each argument will be escaped and joined with spaces to form a single argument for the shell's \fB\-c\fP option.

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sudo (1)
